OL,3,GNEWSACity centre's #90m refurbishment  
OL,4,Agets approval                          
OL,6,FA multimillion-pound refurbishment of  
OL,7,Fmajor buildings and overhaul of the    
OL,8,Fmarket place in Cambridge city centre  
OL,9,Fhas been approved.                     
OL,11,FThe city council has agreed to pay     
OL,12,Falmost #90m to carry out work to the   
OL,13,FGuildhall, Corn Exchange and Market    
OL,14,FSquare. A further #7.5m contingency    
OL,15,Ffund was also approved.                
OL,17,FWork is due to start in January and is 
OL,18,Fexpected to be completed by August     
OL,19,F2029.                                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
