OL,3,GNEWSACity centre's #90m refurbishment  
OL,4,Agets approval                          
OL,6,FA council meeting on Thursday was told 
OL,7,Fthe local authority should recoup the  
OL,8,Fmoney within 30 years as a result of   
OL,9,Fincome generated by the refurbished    
OL,10,Ffacilities.                            
